{"articleNo":"145416","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=145416&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[K-RC교육원] 2016-1학기 재학생 생활관 2차 추가합격자 발표 및 등록 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.02.15","hit":"3990","attachments":[{"name":"2016-1학기 2차 추가 합격자 명단.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=145416&attachNo=74695"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2016-1학기 생활관 2차 추가합격자를 다음과 같이 발표하오니 생활관비를 기한내에 납부하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 생활관 합격자 확인 : [원스톱서비스 - 학생지원 - 생활관 - 신청결과] 에서 확인 가능</span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">▣ 등록안내</span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">가. 납부기간</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> : </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><font color=\"#ea1919\">2016. 2. 15(월) ~ 2. 17(수) 16:00까지</font></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">나. 납부은행</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> : 농협은행 전국지점</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">다. 고지서 출력</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> : 원스톱서비스-생활관-생활관비 고지내역 조회/출력</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">라. 농협 방문 납부 </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">: 고지서 지참하여 납부(은행 영업시간 10:00~16:00)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">마. 개인별 가상계좌번호로 생활관비 계좌이체</span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- <strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">계좌이체시 17일 17시까지 납부가능&nbsp;</font></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- 인터넷뱅킹, 폰뱅킹 무통장입금 등 가능(이체수수료 발생 가능)</span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0900ff; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">받는 사람(학생 본인 이름) 필히 확인</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- 보내는 사람은 학생 이름이 아니라도 상관없음</span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0900ff; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">가상계좌번호는 매학기 변경됨</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">바. 생활관비 납부 확인 방법</span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 은행 확인 : <strong>실시간</strong></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">학교 확인 : <font color=\"#0900ff\">납부 다음날 10:00 이후(원스톱서비스-생활관-납부내역 조회)</font></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#cc3d3d\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #666666; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; -</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #f40000; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> <u>납부기간 내 미등록자는 별도의 통보없이 합격을 취소함</u></span></font></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp; ※ <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">문의</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> : 푸름관 478-7943, 7944 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 오름관 478-7201, 7202</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 추후 선발 방법이 미확정인 관계로 후보순은 공개하지&nbsp;않음&nbsp;</span></strong></font></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&